00291: #===============================================================================
00292: # The user consumes its held berry increases its Defense by 2 stages. It also
00293: # gains the berry's effect if it has one. The berry can be consumed even if
00294: # Unnerve/Magic Room apply. Fails if the user is not holding a berry. This move
00295: # cannot be chosen to be used if the user is not holding a berry. (Stuff Cheeks)
00296: #===============================================================================
